commit d26fa952d579d52642970560c719d24fa2a89f8a
Author: Jarod Castillo <43973221+Smotto@users.noreply.github.com>
Date:   Thu Nov 5 17:44:06 2026 +0000

    psi: fuse terminal calls into the caller activation (#1909)
    
    The composed state graph kept only the recursive component, so an
    acyclic terminal call stayed an ordinary call and left temporary
    cleanup on a separate activation. Fusing every body-present terminal
    target puts that cleanup in the caller. A declared mutable home is
    the current occupant: in-place stores update it, and the jump moves
    that home instead of establishing the place name again.
    
    Nine nested_machine_invocation pins under tests/omega/pass/facts
    agree on omega run --both (native exit 0 and interpreter exit 0).
    The local reject twin still rejects a terminal expression that
    returns bool where T is required. The corpus golden already disagrees
    with origin/main on the specialized-name suffix for this filter, so
    those rows were not re-recorded.

